  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Added SdkUpdateManager with auto-update and rollback capabilities: CheckForUpdateAsync() queries server for new versions, DownloadUpdateAsync() with progress tracking, ApplyUpdateAsync() stages updates for next restart, CompletePendingUpdate() applies updates on startup, Rollback() restores previous version. Includes LicenseClient extension methods EnableAutoUpdates(), CheckAndApplyUpdateAsync(), RollbackUpdate(). Events: UpdateAvailable, UpdateApplied, RollbackCompleted. API endpoint /api/updates/sdk/check added to backend.",
